# do-manager

Follow **`AGENTS.md`** at the repository root for commands, architecture, testing, and safety rules.

**Monorepo:** `packages/core` (domain) → `apps/api` (Hono + SQLite) + `apps/web` (React). Web calls API over HTTP; do not import API code into web.

**Before finishing:** run relevant checks from AGENTS.md (`pnpm test`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint` when TS changed). Keep diffs minimal. No commits unless asked.

**Do not edit without explicit approval:** `.env*`, `data/`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, `apps/api/drizzle/**`, CI workflows, applied migration history.

**Domain:** state transitions live in `packages/core/src/state-machine.ts`; API is authoritative over UI buttons.
